x with longer consideration + higher assisted LTV. Q4 + Valentine's + Mother's Day drive 40-55% of annual revenue. First qualified traffic: 1-2 weeks. Optimised ROAS: 4-8 weeks. Break-even unit economics: 3-6 months for well-positioned brands. Compounding brand + retention + LTV: 6-18 months. Q4 + seasonal + occasion peaks concentrate 40-55% of annual revenue for occasion-driven categories."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you work with luxury + premium jewellery brands or only mass-market?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Both. Our jewellery portfolio spans mass-accessible + affordable-premium + premium + luxury + ultra-luxury positioning. We adapt playbooks per positioning tier. Los Angeles is a peak premium + D2C market and we have specific luxury go-to-market expertise (VIP + concierge + boutique + editorial + heritage storytelling)."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How do I book a discovery call or connect with your team for Los Angeles?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Three ways to start. Calendly: book a 30-min senior discovery call (no cost, no obligation). WhatsApp: chat with us directly. Contact form: fill the contact form. Senior strategist responds within 24 hours with a fixed-quote SOW. Prefer video? We do Zoom + Google Meet + Teams. In-person meetings on request for material engagements."}}]}
